        ],
        Brain: {
            memories: {}
        },
        CanPickUpLoot: 0b,
        CustomNameVisible: 1b,
        DialogData: {
            Type: "STANDARD",
            DialogDataSet: [
                {
                    Conditions: [
                        {
                            Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                            Operation: "EQUALS",
                            Name: "traded_selith"
                        }
                    ],
                    Priority: 20,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Ask how the deal was struck",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "OPEN_NAMED_DIALOG",
                                    Cmd: "seal"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "seal_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "She is in good hands",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "How is the fire keeping? Do not let her sweet-talk you — she eats better than I do and she knows it. Meanwhile the whisker-fish has already called tomorrow for rain. I am delighted with it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "The hut is damper without her and I find I do not mind. The Barboach naps in the rain barrel and twitches before every storm. A fish that tells the weather is worth ten that only look pretty."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Selith — the whisker-fish",
                    Label: "after"
                },
                {
                    Priority: 10,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Trade a Barboach for the Salandit",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "COMMAND",
                                    ExecAsUser: 1b,
                                    Cmd: "cobblemon-initiative trade barboach salandit 28 traded_selith"
                                },
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Conditions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "PLAYER_TAG",
                                    Operation: "EQUALS",
                                    Name: "no_traded_selith"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "trade_button"
                        },
                        {
                            Name: "Not parting with a fish today",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "decline_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "See the lamp by the door? Not a lamp. Salandit. Ember hatched in my firebox two winters back and the damp has never once put her out. But a fire in a marsh is a guest, not a resident, and I am tired of apologizing to the bog for her. So — bring me a Barboach. The mud-whisker fish, the one that feels weather coming through its face. Straight across: your fish out of the pools, my flame to somewhere with more to burn."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "No coin in this. Coin gets counted, and a counted trade belongs to whoever prints the coin — hand to hand is the only exchange the Company cannot see. A Barboach from your party for my Salandit, even trade. She is the only flame that likes the wet, and I am asking you to take her somewhere drier anyway. That is the whole deal and I will not be improving it."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Selith — the ember keeper",
                    Label: "default"
                },
                {
                    Priority: -1,
                    Buttons: [
                        {
                            Name: "Warm on both counts",
                            Actions: [
                                {
                                    Type: "CLOSE_DIALOG"
                                }
                            ],
                            Label: "leave_button"
                        }
                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Struck, hand to hand, and no ledger the wiser. Keep her warm and she will keep you warm back. That is not marsh poetry, that is a fire safety notice."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Selith — struck",
                    Label: "seal"
                }
            ]
        },
